        "original_id": "00df4d49-fa87-567f-8ca0-85608e620ad0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Pinocchio (1940 film), Home on the Range (2004 film), Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs (1937), The Adventures of Pinocchio\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions, Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures\n- People: Carlo Collodi\n- Topics: animated films, Disney feature films\n\nFacts:\n- Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs is a 1937 animated feature film whose success preceded Disney's production of Pinocchio.\n- Pinocchio is a 1940 American animated musical fantasy film produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- Pinocchio was based on The Adventures of Pinocchio, an Italian children's novel by Carlo Collodi.\n- Pinocchio was the second animated feature film produced by Disney.\n- Home on the Range is a 2004 American animated musical western comedy film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation.\n- Home on the Range was released by Walt Disney Pictures.",
